1 NOTE Torbjorn b.1849: Name in Norway Census from Don Jahr.
2 CONT Norway Name Torbjorn Gunderson
2 CONT He came to the southern part of Minnesota in the early seventies and
2 CONT homesteaded in Clay County.  The branch line of the Northern Pacific r
2 CONC ailway
2 CONT running north from Winnipeg Junction was opened in 1885 and Mr  Anders
2 CONC on
2 CONT founded the post office and village of Hitterdal when he put up the fi
2 CONC rst
2 CONT building.  He was Hitterdals first postmaster and storekeeper and was
2 CONT instrumental in giving the town the name it bears.
2 CONT He had much to do with building and maintaining Synod Lutheran Church.
