2 CONC wed mother Sonnove came in the spring of 1858 on the sailship Drobak
2 CONC .  After 7 weeks they landed at Quebec and went by steamboat to Chicag
2 CONC o, by rail to LaCrosse Wisconsin then overland to settle in the townsh
2 CONC ip of Hamburg - Vernon County Wisconsin (Coon Valley).
