1 NOTE When we (Carl, Wanda and Gudrun) were at LaCrosse Wi for a Solar Lag w
2 CONC e went to Norskedalen Museum. there we met the Lady (a Grimsrud who wa
2 CONC s married to a Brye) who lived on the farm that was Johan's.  She invi
2 CONC ted us to the farm and while there she showed us a trunk that had th
2 CONC e Grimsrud name from Oier in 1858.  This was the trunk that Gulbrand a
2 CONC nd his mother had brought from Norway.  The next morning she called u
2 CONC s at the motel and said if we wanted it we could come back to the far
2 CONC m and get it which we did.  A wonderful piece with which to make a con
2 CONC nection with Gudbransdal Norway.
